        <parameter>
            <valueName>layer:SOREM:1.0:Broadcast_Text</valueName>
            <value>At 6:50 p.m. Mountain Daylight Time Saturday, Environment Canada has updated a tornado warning for West Central and North Central Alberta. Extra care and attention should be exercised. The following localities are included in the warning: Edson, Niton Junction and Wildwood. Environment Canada meteorologists are tracking a severe thunderstorm that is possibly producing a tornado. Damaging winds, large hail and locally intense rainfall are also possible. Take cover immediately if threatening weather approaches. Please consult local media for more information.</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>layer:EC-MSC-SMC:1.1:Designation_Code</valueName>
            <value>AB_00_01_LAND</value>
        </parameter>
